Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.27,0:00:11.68,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I am a replacement for my older \Nsister, Anastasia, who passed away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.83,0:00:16.69,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I came here for the purpose \Nof a political marriage...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.29,0:00:19.55,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,as no more than a mock fiancée, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.01,0:00:23.41,Flashback,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please tell me about yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.38,0:00:30.38,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Things... I like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.72,0:02:02.85,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fnArial\shad0\fs16\bord0\c&H37221B&\pos(106,132)}Marie \Nis \NLife
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.55,0:02:06.22,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Oh, Marie...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.59,0:02:07.51,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.89,0:02:12.69,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(447,559)\c&HE7E7D8&\3c&H261D24&\4c&H203B59&\pos(427,321)}Episode 4 "I've Found the Things I Like"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.38,0:02:11.63,Default Top,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio, if you're here, please say something!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.63,0:02:12.82,Default Top,Mio,0,0,0,,I just did.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.34,0:02:17.06,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Seeing Marie after four days \Napart, what did you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.34,0:02:18.05,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I love her!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.05,0:02:18.83,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.17,0:02:21.12,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,She's grown even more beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.87,0:02:25.22,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Five days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.22,0:02:30.53,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,you said to provide Lady Marie with our utmost \Nhospitality, and everything she truly deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.53,0:02:32.09,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You did say that, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:33.09,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.36,0:02:37.53,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Her treatment in the baron's \Nhousehold was clearly wretched.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.53,0:02:42.34,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie believes herself to be \Nugly and unworthy of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.01,0:02:47.87,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,So I want to give her every luxury she \Ndesires so that she can build some confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.87,0:02:50.61,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I want her to know that \Nshe is worthy of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.93,0:02:53.67,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,No matter how many luxuries \Nyou may pile before her,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:55.70,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie will likely avoid them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.70,0:02:56.62,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.62,0:02:58.82,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.27,0:03:03.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I am an abandoned child, but I was lucky \Nenough to be taken in by Lady Liu Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.66,0:03:08.01,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I was elevated to the position of \Nhead chamberlain of Granado Castle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.01,0:03:11.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,a position far above my \Nstation, by you, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.93,0:03:14.42,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,For that, I owe you an \Nimmense debt of gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.68,0:03:17.30,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What is all of this? It isn't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:23.06,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It is because of this that I can \Nunderstand a little of Lady Marie's feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:28.51,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,What it's like to go from a life of oppression \Nto becoming a resident in a gleaming castle...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.51,0:03:29.96,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,and the fear that creates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:33.07,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The sudden appearance \Nof a charming prince...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.07,0:03:35.38,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,all the dresses and \Nshoes, bestowed upon her...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.38,0:03:39.88,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,She wonders if it's all some ephemeral \Nmagic, that will one day suddenly disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.07,0:03:43.02,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,It won't disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.90,0:03:46.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie is beautiful and intelligent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.75,0:03:49.44,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Mio, you're a brilliant head chamberlain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.44,0:03:53.15,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,and Liu Liu thinks of you \Nas her own daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.08,0:03:58.59,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,That isn't magic, it's reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:02.62,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.62,0:04:04.82,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master, you are exactly as you should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.82,0:04:09.86,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please continue believing in the truth\N of these commonplace things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:12.45,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are you being sarcastic?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.45,0:04:15.40,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Not at all. I'm complimenting you \Nfrom the bottom of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.94,0:04:22.44,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I'll have to leave \Nthe castle on business again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.44,0:04:27.40,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I want you to use your discretion to \Nensure that Marie is comfortable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.40,0:04:30.52,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,May I also review issues \Npertaining to personnel?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.52,0:04:31.53,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You may.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.01,0:04:34.64,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Those are the words I've waited for.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.64,0:04:35.89,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Still...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.96,0:04:40.25,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Is it all right for Marie \Nto be that adorable?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.64,0:04:41.64,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.64,0:04:45.92,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,She's so elegant dressed up, \Nbut splendid in lounge wear, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.92,0:04:47.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Will this take long?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.93,0:04:50.75,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Smart and well-read, yet so naïve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.75,0:04:52.01,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,She stirs my protective instincts!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.01,0:04:54.25,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,She's a good listener and fun to talk to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:56.28,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,She's brimming with a sparkling curiosity!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:58.85,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Her smiling face and laugh have \Nthe impact of a ballista strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.85,0:05:01.60,Default Top,Kyros; background,0,0,0,,Her figure makes everything look stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.60,0:05:00.90,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,You're speaking incredibly quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:03.96,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,We're talking about {\i1}those{\i0} \Nlooks with {\i1}that{\i0} personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.96,0:05:06.30,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,The synergy increases her \Nadorableness a hundredfold!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.30,0:05:08.99,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master, I don't think you're in \Na position to speak of others.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:09.71,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.21,0:05:13.29,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please go to sleep now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:15.29,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,If you don't, you'll regret it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.29,0:05:19.16,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\b1\fnArial\shad0\fs16\bord0\c&H201308&\pos(32,298)}Marie is Life
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.13,0:05:18.62,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.13,0:05:24.05,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Now, then. I've received permission \Nto redirect personnel.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.59,0:05:26.98,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I should take action as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.29,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Is this an appropriate quantity?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.29,0:05:38.96,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes! I will be able to finish all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.50,0:05:43.90,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,That was delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.44,0:05:47.44,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please allow me to join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:49.44,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What? You don't mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:52.30,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,While you are dining, I have \Nmy work as your server,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.30,0:05:54.29,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,but I can accompany you for tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.56,0:05:55.81,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.81,0:05:58.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mio, I've been wanting to have \Ntea with you for so long!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.98,0:05:59.79,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.21,0:06:05.00,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mio, if you're here, does that mean \Nthat Lord Kyros has already left?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.50,0:06:10.07,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,No, we've switched assignments.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.07,0:06:13.35,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Ilza and Hannah are serving the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:15.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I thought that might be best for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:18.36,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.90,0:06:25.04,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,She's right. I'm certain they'll be happier \Nif they're able to serve real nobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.20,0:06:26.95,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Come in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:30.72,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,My lady! I, Toppo, have brought \Nmy latest delicious experiment!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:31.80,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Would you like some?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.80,0:06:32.67,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I would!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.57,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,A white... pudding?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:42.39,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,It's a blancmange made with \Nalmond flour and fresh milk!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.39,0:06:44.00,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Miss Mio, you should have some, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.03,0:06:48.64,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, it's so jiggly!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.91,0:06:53.61,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.61,0:06:55.86,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Toppo's food really is \Nthe best in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:58.85,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,I must hurry and make enough \Nfor everyone in the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.85,0:07:00.52,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,I, Toppo, will take my leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.52,0:07:01.70,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.05,0:07:06.82,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's just that Ilza and Hannah \Nmay not like milk very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.14,0:07:09.83,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I haven't heard anything about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.17,0:07:12.82,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,But when I asked for milk for my tea,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.82,0:07:15.27,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,they said that was a novel way to drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.02,0:07:16.99,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.74,0:07:20.13,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It must be that they don't like milk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.13,0:07:22.83,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Would it be possible to make \Nthose without using milk?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:25.88,Default,Toppo,0,0,0,,Understood, my lady! I will give it a try!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.65,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Thank you, Toppo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:32.20,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Lady Marie, you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.42,0:07:43.19,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm sure that Ilza and Hannah will \Nbe shocked at how delicious it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.75,0:07:45.36,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Oh! My lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:50.86,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,I was just on my way to your room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.39,0:07:53.07,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Tomas, what is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.07,0:07:55.63,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,It arrived for my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.63,0:07:58.00,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,It's from her family, the \Nhouse of Baron Shaderan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.50,0:08:01.50,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Tomas! Why did you bring that here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:12.20,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,B-But the master said that anything \Nfrom the House of Shaderan
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:15.30,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,should be given to the lady if \Nher attendants said it was okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.30,0:08:17.20,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,If you know that, then why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:18.93,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I haven't inspected that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.93,0:08:24.23,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,What? But Miss Hannah and Miss Ilza looked \Nit over and said to take it to the lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.83,0:08:34.29,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,These are, without a doubt, my things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.76,0:08:37.70,Italics,Elvira,0,0,0,,Congratulations on your engagement.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.70,0:08:41.08,Italics,Elvira,0,0,0,,You left behind some essential items \Nfor your work in the count's household.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.95,0:08:55.23,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,"The Story of the Raggedy Red Cat."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.60,0:08:58.39,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,The thread in the binding has \Nbeen frail for a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.39,0:09:00.63,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,but I'm certain that I \Nput it away carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.96,0:09:04.93,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry! I've done \Nsomething awful, haven't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.51,0:09:06.14,Default Top,Ilza,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Hey, let me go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.14,0:09:08.06,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,Release me immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:08.73,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:10.47,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.47,0:09:12.35,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,How dare you?! You're just a maid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.06,0:09:14.78,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,And so are the two of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.78,0:09:18.92,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,What?! We served the third prince \Nin the palace, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.92,0:09:22.53,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,Prince Luiphon recommended us\N to Granado Castle personally!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.53,0:09:25.32,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,And I am the head of the servants \Nhere at Granado Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.69,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,You're just some old-timer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.69,0:09:30.96,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,You were just demoted to serving \Nthe daughter of a destitute baron.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:33.17,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,And I was the one who \Narranged for that transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.55,0:09:35.11,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,Don't talk down to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.11,0:09:37.07,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,Actually, it's well known, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.07,0:09:38.69,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,The countess is a barbarian,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:41.97,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,and a former prostitute, who set up her \Nchild with a client as a maid here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.97,0:09:46.10,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,What? I thought the child was an orphan, \Nabandoned on the side of the road at birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.71,0:09:47.89,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,She lacks a surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.89,0:09:50.86,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,It's hilarious to think she's \Nserving in a count's castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.10,0:09:56.86,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I see. So you truly are imbeciles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.86,0:09:59.28,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:09.17,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Now, it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.17,0:10:11.22,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:18.22,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,My deepest apologies. This is all due \Nto my ineptitude as a supervisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.87,0:10:23.47,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's all right. More importantly, \Nmay I borrow some scissors and thread?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:28.76,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Johan!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.20,0:10:30.91,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,My lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.91,0:10:32.65,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,Y-Your clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.30,0:10:36.67,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I remade some of my old clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.67,0:10:39.39,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,You said you'd show me around \Nthe garden, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.39,0:10:41.36,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Getting these a bit dirty is fine.\N
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:44.09,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,Is that all?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.09,0:10:47.37,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,There were plenty of servants' shoes\N I could have offered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.37,0:10:49.21,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh! Yes, we could have done that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.10,0:10:52.38,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,Well, no matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.51,0:11:08.49,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I've realized it for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.49,0:11:10.18,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,The things I like...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.93,0:11:13.57,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I always thought I was doing \Neverything for my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.57,0:11:16.14,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,but the truth is all the \Nhard labor felt like nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.58,0:11:20.50,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,780)}because of how much I love \Ngrowing delicious vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.29,0:11:25.77,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I really do have things I like \Nand things I want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.98,0:11:29.77,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I was brusque \Ntoward you before now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.77,0:11:34.48,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,I thought that I shouldn't cause trouble for \Nyou, the count's lady, by speaking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:35.80,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.80,0:11:39.43,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,I am a servant. And I'm a foreigner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.43,0:11:41.34,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:46.55,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,We're living in the same house. \NThat makes us family, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.14,0:11:56.01,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I haven't officially become his fiancée \Nyet, but everyone here seems like a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.33,0:12:00.36,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,You say the same things as the master does.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.36,0:12:01.62,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,As Lord Kyros?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.62,0:12:02.87,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,My lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.75,0:12:06.16,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,The master is leaving!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.40,0:12:10.09,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.89,0:12:15.82,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Oh, Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.82,0:12:19.32,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The master stayed up all \Nnight, so he's rather exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.46,0:12:19.21,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(234,472)\fs20\an5\bord1\shad0\fnArial\pos(309,170)\c&HEBCE3C&\b1}Last Night
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.64,0:12:19.61,Flashback Top,Kyros; background,0,0,0,,Oh, Marie! I love you, Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:21.96,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,My, he truly is busy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:27.40,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,More importantly, master, if you will be \Nvisiting the palace for an evening party...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.96,0:12:26.76,Default Top,Ilza,0,0,0,,Let us go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.76,0:12:28.88,Default Top,Hannah,0,0,0,,Stay away, you filthy servant!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.88,0:12:31.82,Default Top,Ilza; background,0,0,0,,You're filthy and you stink!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.44,0:12:32.55,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,please return that dead \Nweight to Prince Luiphon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.55,0:12:36.93,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,D-Did you just call us dead weight? \NWe're here at his recommendation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.93,0:12:40.04,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,That's right! He said that one \Nday, we'd be his concubines.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.04,0:12:41.32,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,All of this...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.32,0:12:43.03,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,...is your fault!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:47.25,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,You're just the daughter of a \Nbroke baron lured by money!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.25,0:12:49.32,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,You're no more than your \Ndead sister's replacement!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:53.01,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,Everyone knows Shaderan's youngest\N daughter is a losing prospect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.01,0:12:56.34,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,And it's the count who will be a \Nlaughingstock for pulling the short straw!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:59.33,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Lord Kyros... a laughingstock?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.55,0:13:01.40,Default,Ilza,0,0,0,,You need to learn your place!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.40,0:13:02.85,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,Ugly wench!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.62,0:13:04.83,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What part of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.39,0:13:08.13,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Try saying that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.13,0:13:11.34,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What part of my family,\Nof Marie, do you find ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.34,0:13:13.30,Default,Hannah,0,0,0,,No, it's just...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:17.24,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,And all this talk of noble \Nhouses and money...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.24,0:13:19.48,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,those aren't things that \Nbelong to you, are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.91,0:13:24.08,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Are either of you more beautiful than \NMarie? More honorable? More clever?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.08,0:13:26.11,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Cuter? Are you any of those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.58,0:13:29.21,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What about you could I possibly love?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.83,0:13:32.30,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Please, tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.64,0:13:35.50,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Because I can't find a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:44.07,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.07,0:13:44.72,Default,Tomas,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.26,0:13:49.28,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.28,0:13:50.09,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.02,0:13:54.61,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,They said I'm the reason \Nthey'll laugh at you, Lord Kyros.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.08,0:14:03.08,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.61,0:14:08.27,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,You are beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.19,0:14:10.90,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,There's nothing here to laugh at.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.57,0:14:14.28,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Your beautiful red hair,\Nset off so well by this green...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:16.36,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Your eyes that shine like stars...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:19.32,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Your overflowing knowledge and curiosity...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.32,0:14:22.30,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Your innocent smile when you \Nspeak of things you love...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.96,0:14:26.89,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,Altogether beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.59,0:14:35.24,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Ahem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.24,0:14:38.23,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Master, we are out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.10,0:14:41.54,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,We can wait another few seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.54,0:14:43.80,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,but I'm certain that wouldn't suffice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.80,0:14:45.72,Default,Kyros,0,0,0,,What? Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.11,0:14:52.18,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,Oh, the poor master.\NAnd just when he was so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.93,0:14:56.89,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,I only came for herbs to \Nuse in some treatments,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.89,0:14:59.11,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,but I managed to witness \Nsomething very nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:00.08,Default,Tunika,0,0,0,,Don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.08,0:15:03.49,Default,Johan,0,0,0,,Do you think the oregano \NI grew was useful?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.42,0:15:07.63,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(651,1)\fnArial\shad0\an8\pos(75,13)\c&H3F5062&\3c&HAFCEF4&\b1}They saw\Neverything...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.01,0:15:11.52,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,I was told that Lord Kyros was going \Nto the royal palace for a ceremony,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:13.62,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,and that he would be away for ten days.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.62,0:15:14.89,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,When he returned,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.88,0:15:17.62,Default Top,Kyros; background,0,0,0,,Marie! I will return soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.89,0:15:18.08,Narration,Marie; narration,0,0,0,,we would begin arrangements\Nfor our betrothal ceremony in earnest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.36,0:15:26.12,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,There's nothing here to laugh at.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.12,0:15:29.18,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,That's what Lord Kyros said, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.95,0:15:34.40,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.02,0:15:37.03,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It isn't meant to be a threat, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.26,0:15:40.91,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,No, it isn't. It's written as an invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.88,0:15:43.77,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,"Lady Marie Shaderan,"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.77,0:15:49.77,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,"I wish to congratulate you upon your \Nbetrothal to my old friend Count Kyros Granado."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.14,0:15:51.92,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It's normal up to that point.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.21,0:15:57.84,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,"As such, we have planned a special \Nevent utilizing our means and efforts."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.63,0:16:05.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,"Notice has been spread throughout the royal \Ncapital, and the people eagerly await the day."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.53,0:16:09.98,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,"Lady Marie, should you be unable to attend, \Neverything will have been for naught."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.33,0:16:14.90,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,"The people will despair, and their \Ndistress shall surely span generations."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:17.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,797)}"Please, you simply must attend."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.04,0:16:21.59,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It certainly does sound like a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.59,0:16:24.38,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,This gentleman is a prince, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.38,0:16:25.00,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:30.01,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,He is the third prince and the \Ncaptain of the Royal Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:32.47,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,He has quite an open-hearted personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.01,0:16:36.70,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,The fact that this arrived \Non the eve of the event
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:38.23,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,shows that he expects you to attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.78,0:16:49.61,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.61,0:16:52.03,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,A chariot from the Royal Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.35,0:17:33.90,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,A-And this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.31,0:17:39.16,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,A military fortress for the Kingdom of Diltz, \Nthe stronghold of the Royal Knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:42.78,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,A-Am I going to be publicly executed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.78,0:17:44.16,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.47,0:17:47.02,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,B-But why the fortress?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:49.51,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I could have been with \NLord Kyros if it were the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.51,0:17:53.42,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Prince Luiphon is the one who \Nrecommended Hannah and Ilza.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.42,0:17:55.00,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,He must want to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.01,0:17:59.64,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\b1\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\fs20\c&H225457&\3c&HDFE4E7&\bord1.5\t(1523,2858,1 \fs17)\move(505,63,333,92,1523,2858)}Returned Goods
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.37,0:17:59.34,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,That only increases my fear of an execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.08,0:18:03.63,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.63,0:18:07.87,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,If Prince Luiphon is the host, he likely \Nhas some amusing plans in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:08.56,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Plans?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.21,0:18:11.04,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Monster scares...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:12.89,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,A rain of onions from above...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.42,0:18:15.37,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Or perhaps a pool full of jelly...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:18.58,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Just what sort of person is Prince Luiphon?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.58,0:18:20.81,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Well, he is not a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.81,0:18:23.37,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Since we're here, I believe \Nwe should enjoy the fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.73,0:18:38.47,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,It's all so lively.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.78,0:18:42.32,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It's been fifty years since the \Nwar. The world is at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.32,0:18:44.26,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,This sort of excitement \Nis good entertainment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.08,0:18:46.35,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Please have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.67,0:18:48.97,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.35,0:18:51.31,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1360,1)\fnArial\shad0\an8\c&H384848&\3c&H6FE6F4&\b1\fs22\pos(206,15)}When did she buy this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.97,0:18:51.32,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,First, I should go and greet \NPrince Luiphon, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.65,0:18:55.51,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,No, he probably isn't waiting \Nfor a greeting from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.51,0:18:58.24,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It's possible that he hasn't \Neven come here at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.24,0:19:02.20,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What? So, I'm meant to simply \Nenjoy the festivities and leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.20,0:19:07.15,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Who can say? I don't understand what goes \Non in Prince Luiphon's head at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.81,0:19:14.25,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,I feel like Mio is a little \Nharsh towards the prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:22.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I wonder, does this feel like a small \Nevent for someone of the royal family?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.69,0:19:26.23,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,No, events on this scale are fairly rare.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:27.35,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,What concerns me...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.30,0:19:33.87,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,is that not a single rumor of it \Nreached us at Granado Castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.23,0:19:38.82,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,If Prince Luiphon issued a gag order before \Nexecuting these arrangements, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.97,0:19:43.18,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I have a bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.57,0:19:45.35,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,M-Mio?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:46.41,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Prince Luiphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.40,0:19:50.13,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Where? What does he look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.13,0:19:52.32,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Down on the left by the stone wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:54.29,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Silver hair, wearing a \Nknight's military uniform.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.17,0:19:57.29,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Mio, how can you see so well?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.29,0:20:00.55,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I will go and check. Lady Marie, \Nplease wait for me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.55,0:20:01.84,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I'll go with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.99,0:20:06.58,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,It may be that he's made one of his \Nmen dress as him to lure us out...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.58,0:20:10.41,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,as part of a plan to suddenly \Nappear and scare you, Lady Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.41,0:20:11.01,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.01,0:20:13.82,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,Don't move from this spot until I return.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.82,0:20:16.26,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,No matter who calls out to \Nyou, please ignore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.26,0:20:17.43,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:18.81,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,I will return shortly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:22.49,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\NI won't take a single step!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:26.62,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,Hello? Standing right in front of my \Nshop like that is a problem for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.62,0:20:28.50,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.62,0:20:33.25,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs14\pos(92,7)\c&H0D0F14&\3c&HFDFDFD&\shad0\fnArial\b1\fad(483,1)}Looking for contestants\Nfor an apple peeling contest!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.85,0:20:32.15,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,Contestants for an apple peeling contest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.15,0:20:33.24,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,That sounds like fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.06,0:20:35.79,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Excuse me, I'd like to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.79,0:20:37.77,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,What? That's unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.77,0:20:41.14,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,I thought that noble \Ngirls didn't use knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.56,0:20:47.73,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I-If a noble's wife peeled apples...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.30,0:20:50.61,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,would it make her husband \Na laughingstock, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.86,0:20:52.54,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:55.03,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,You've gotta peel an apple to eat it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.18,0:20:59.55,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,And our apples are delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.44,0:21:02.07,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1361,1)\an8\fs17\frz9.062\pos(135,138)\shad1.5\fnArial\c&H5A6164&\3c&HFDFEFF&\4c&HD6DADB&}A Certain Prince Affiliated\Nwith the Knights
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.55,0:21:02.08,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,They've got the knights' \Nseal of approval, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.43,0:21:05.69,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, they look quite delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.69,0:21:07.03,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,I'd very much like to compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:08.16,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,All righty then!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:10.60,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,If you can peel an entire apple \Nwithin the time limit,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.60,0:21:12.71,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,I'll give you an entire box of apples!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.71,0:21:14.62,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,Start on my mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.86,0:21:15.78,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.78,0:21:17.98,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,Then, here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.55,0:21:21.89,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,What a delicious-looking apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.43,0:21:28.17,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Th-That's mine! Please give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.54,0:21:31.42,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Hmm, what to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:32.49,Default Top,Marie,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.42,0:21:33.35,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Come on! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.35,0:21:35.23,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Maybe you don't really want it after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.89,0:21:41.23,Default,Marie,0,0,0,,Oh! My apple!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.23,0:21:43.27,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Yes, this is a good year for them, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.27,0:21:46.87,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,Honestly. My customer was \Nenjoying herself, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.45,0:21:46.43,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(271,209)\fs12\shad0\fnArial\an8\c&H4D474D&\3c&HE4E3EB&\bord1.5\move(304,93,303,77,104,771)}Here's the\Nmoney
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:50.10,Default,apple seller,0,0,0,,What point is there in the host \Nruining it {\i1}all{\i0}, Your Highness?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.10,0:21:51.20,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,What? "Your Highness"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.20,0:21:55.76,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Now, now. I simply wanted to have a \Nlittle fun with my friend's fiancée.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.33,0:21:57.24,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:22:00.38,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,S-So this gentleman really is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.00,0:22:01.42,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(402,1)\b1\fnArial\shad0\an8\c&H121410&\shad0\bord0\fs22\frz322.9\fax-0.16\pos(266,42)}THUD THUD THUD
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:04.29,Default,Mio,0,0,0,,So it was a trap after all, \Nwasn't it, Prince Luiphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.81,0:22:09.53,Default,Luipohn,0,0,0,,I am Luiphon Sandhalkia Diltz,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.53,0:22:12.01,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,third prince of this land and \Ncaptain of the knights.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.31,0:22:14.49,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,But perhaps most of all...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.69,0:22:17.97,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I am dear Kyros' friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.36,0:22:21.02,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you, sweet Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.74,0:22:24.70,Italics,Marie; internal,0,0,0,,S-So this is the sort of person he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.49,0:24:00.47,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Hey there, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.47,0:24:03.34,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I am Prince Luiphon!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.66,0:24:07.57,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Kyros and I have been the best of \Nfriends since our school days!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.57,0:24:11.66,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Is sweet Marie worthy \Nof being his betrothed?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.66,0:24:15.13,Default,Luiphon,0,0,0,,I will ascertain the truth of \Nit through a special surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.21,0:24:19.59,Default Top,Luiphon,0,0,0,,Next time, "The Prince and \Nthe Pitch-Black Warrior."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.06,0:24:27.01,Episode Title,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,1)\4c&H8F8C8B&\3c&H383838&\pos(433,321)}Episode 5 "The Prince and the Pitch-Black Warrior"
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.06,0:24:22.15,Default Top,Luiphon,0,0,0,,You'll come and watch, of course, won't you?
